10:["$","p","p-6",{"children":["在 Go 1.25 中，网络编程的依然遵循着 Go 诞生之初的哲学：",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Goroutine-per-connection"}],"。开发者编写的是标准的",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"同步阻塞式（Synchronous Blocking）"}]," 代码。"]}]
11:["$","pre","pre-0",{"data-language":"GO","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-Go","children":[["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"// 开发者视角：逻辑是线性的"}],"\nlistener, _ := net.Listen(",["$","span","span-1",{"className":"hljs-string","children":"\"tcp\""}],", ",["$","span","span-2",{"className":"hljs-string","children":"\":8080\""}],")\n",["$","span","span-3",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"for"}]," {\n    conn, _ := listener.Accept() ",["$","span","span-4",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"// 看起来这里阻塞了，直到有新连接"}],"\n    ",["$","span","span-5",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"go"}]," ",["$","span","span-6",{"className":"hljs-function","children":[["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"func"}],["$","span","span-1",{"className":"hljs-params","children":"(c net.Conn)"}]]}]," {\n        buf := ",["$","span","span-7",{"className":"hljs-built_in","children":"make"}],"([]",["$","span","span-8",{"className":"hljs-type","children":"byte"}],", ",["$","span","span-9",{"className":"hljs-number","children":"1024"}],")\n        n, _ := c.Read(buf) ",["$","span","span-10",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"// 看起来这里阻塞了，直到有数据"}],"\n        ",["$","span","span-11",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"// 处理数据..."}],"\n    }(conn)\n}\n"]}]}]
12:["$","p","p-7",{"children":["如果按照 C 语言或早期 Java 的传统线程模型，上述代码意味着每个连接需要一个 OS 线程。但线程太重了（栈内存约 1MB - 8MB，上下文切换成本高）。但是在 Go 语言中，当你调用 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"c.Read"}]," 时，当前的 Goroutine 确实\"暂停\"了，但底层的操作系统线程（M）并没有阻塞，而是去干别的活了。这样开发者拥有了编写简单线性逻辑的权利，同时享受了非阻塞 I/O 的高性能。"]}]
