21:["$","ol","ol-1",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"注册（Register）："}]," 当前运行的 Goroutine (G) 在被挂起前，会将自己的 FD 和期望的事件（如可读）注册到 Netpoller 中。本质上是调用了 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"epoll_ctl"}]," 将 FD 加入监听列表。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"让出（Park）："}]," G 停止运行，M（系统线程）现在空闲了。M 会根据 GMP 调度模型，从 P（处理器）的本地队列中抓取下一个可运行的 G 去执行。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"监控（Poll）："}]," 什么时候唤醒原来的 G？\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"被动触发："}]," 当系统监控线程 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"sysmon"}]," 运行，或者调度器发现没有 G 可运行时，会调用 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"runtime.netpoll"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"底层机制："}]," ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"runtime.netpoll"}]," 内部调用 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"epoll_wait"}],"，询问操作系统我关注的那些 FD 有哪些数据到了。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"唤醒（Ready）："}]," 操作系统返回就绪的 FD 列表。Netpoller 根据 FD 找到当初阻塞在上面的 Goroutine，将其状态改为 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Grunnable"}],"（可运行），并将其注入到当前 P 的本地队列或全局队列中。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"执行："}]," 在下一轮调度中，原来的 G 被 M 拿到，继续执行 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"conn.Read()"}]," 后面的代码。"]}],"\n"]}]
